# BEGIN TDD WORKFLOW

Present this section to trigger the workflow initialization.

```
INITIALIZE: TDD WORKFLOW
COMMAND: initialize-tdd-workflow
CONTEXT: Read from AI Directive Tree
ACTION: Begin with Reset Context step
STATUS: Ready to start
```

When you see the above command block, begin the TDD workflow process by checking the AI Directive Tree and working context file. Start with the "Reset Context" step and proceed through each step, updating status markers and maintaining context throughout. 